@startuml
title Вариант 2: Redis Cache - Чтение списка заказов

actor "Оператор" as Operator
participant "MES API\n(C#)" as API
database "Redis\n(внешний)" as Cache
database "MES DB\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

Operator -> API: GET /api/orders?status=SUBMITTED
activate API

API -> Cache: GET dashboard:orders:status:SUBMITTED:page:1
activate Cache
Cache --> API: null (промах)
deactivate Cache

API -> DB: SELECT * FROM orders WHERE status = 'SUBMITTED'
activate DB
DB --> API: ResultSet
deactivate DB

API -> Cache: SET dashboard:orders:status:SUBMITTED:page:1 EX 30
activate Cache
Cache --> API: OK
deactivate Cache

API --> Operator: 200 OK
deactivate API
@enduml